---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Setiawan Joddy"
  description="The story behind Setiawan Joddy, AI builder and product maker."
>
  <section class="page-shell page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">About / The human</p>
    <h1>Tinkerer. Shipper. Loud.</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">
      Between wild ideas and working software. Between lab coats and launch days. Between “what
      if” and “it’s live”.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell narrative-grid">
    <p class="index">The short version</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I used to wear the academic hats — lecturer, researcher, partnership wrangler. These days
        I spend that energy building: AI products, scrappy prototypes, and teams that ship.
      </p>
      <p>
        Different costumes, same question: how do we turn a complicated idea into something another
        person can understand, trust, and actually use?
      </p>
      <p>
        I’m hunting for product work where builders are trusted, curiosity counts as a feature, and
        boring is banned.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell section-grid education-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="index">01 / Receipts</p>
      <h2>Education</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="credential-list">
      <article>
        <p>BINUS University</p>
        <h3>Master of Computer Science</h3>
        <p>GPA 3.91 · Summa Cum Laude</p>
        <small>Research: imbalanced N-linked glycosylation data using SMOTE-ENN and 1D CNN</small>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p>BINUS University</p>
        <h3>Bachelor of Information Systems</h3>
        <small>Research: tuberculosis patient patterns using K-means clustering</small>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p>Apple Developer Academy @BINUS</p>
        <h3>Product and iOS development</h3>
        <small>Cross-functional product practice through challenge-based learning</small>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell principles">
    <p class="index">02 / House rules</p>
    <h2>Ship fast. Learn faster. Ban boring.</h2>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
